      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk im just really frustrated lol. my doctor is super busy and always tells me to call the office but then i get put on hold for 20 mins. i just want to feel better now. like if i take a double dose for just one or two days, would that really be a big deal? i feel like if i get the BP down faster it wont be so shaky.",
